65,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":1125034058,"text":"よっ！そこの金髪の異郷人…","nextNodeIds":[726820102,726820103]},{"nodeId":726820102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3913901274,"text":"また会ったね。","nextNodeIds":[726820104]},{"nodeId":726820104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":3350139810,"text":"うむ…その金髪、見覚えがある…まさか君は…","nextNodeIds":[726820105]},{"nodeId":726820105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":3880946570,"text":"そうだ！前回の「百人一揆」で大活躍した「黄金の旋風」…","nextNodeIds":[726820106]},{"nodeId":726820106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3313579210,"text":"黄、黄金の旋風…？","nextNodeIds":[726820107]},{"nodeId":726820107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":694874194,"text":"前回は、会場の片隅で参加者を眺めながら、一番盛り上がるシーンを撮ろうと思っていた。そして君は草刈りの黄金の旋風のように、すべての敵を一掃した…","nextNodeIds":[726820108,726820109]},{"nodeId":726820108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3161473842,"text":"お世辞はいいから。","nextNodeIds":[726820113]},{"nodeId":726820113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":1467893722,"text":"実は最近、「百人一揆」を開催してる連中がまた現れたらしい。","nextNodeIds":[726820114,726820118]},{"nodeId":726820114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":438507546,"text":"「百人一揆」ってなんだっけ？","nextNodeIds":[726820115]},{"nodeId":726820115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":713302682,"text":"爽快な戦いを通して、慶祝をしたり、不運を取り除いたりする乱闘大会だ。武士も魔物も、身分を問わず、純粋なる熱血で戦いを繰り広げる祭典！","nextNodeIds":[726820116]},{"nodeId":726820116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":1701822170,"text":"勝ち残った勝者は、さまざまな宝物を獲得できるらしい。","nextNodeIds":[726820117]},{"nodeId":726820117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":4171258562,"text":"主催者や後援者は誰なのかは、まだ謎のままだが。","nextNodeIds":[726820119]},{"nodeId":726820119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":3265274818,"text":"とにかく、こういうことは公で話してはいけない。ついて来てくれ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726820118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":255603818,"text":"なるほど、分かった。","nextNodeIds":[726820119]},{"nodeId":726820109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1751227610,"text":"…もっと褒めて。","nextNodeIds":[726820110]},{"nodeId":726820110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":1099502858,"text":"コホッコホッツ…「もしも剣豪に匹敵する動体視力を持つ観客がいたならば、すぐに分かっただろう。金髪の異邦人が繰り出した術は、古武術の中でも禁術とされている、『ゴウランガ大竜巻』であると！」","nextNodeIds":[726820111]},{"nodeId":726820111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2460652034,"text":"？","nextNodeIds":[726820112]},{"nodeId":726820112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":589300698,"text":"これは、君の勇姿を参考にして書いた物語だ。","nextNodeIds":[726820113]},{"nodeId":726820103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2956227730,"text":"何か依頼があるの？","nextNodeIds":[726820104]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7268201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["30065"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7268202,"order":2,"stepDescription":"茅葺と会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":66610988,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LN